WEBVTT

00:38.617 --> 00:40.083
What exactly...

00:40.083 --> 00:43.330
is going on right now?

00:43.330 --> 00:45.590
Well...

00:53.500 --> 00:55.459
It just looks like...

00:55.459 --> 00:57.511
two people who were into each other

00:57.511 --> 01:00.229
ended up spending the night together...

01:01.626 --> 01:04.103
But I can't explain why he's here with us.

01:04.103 --> 01:07.542
Oh, I stepped outside for a little fresh air.

01:07.542 --> 01:08.683
Oh, yeah!

01:08.683 --> 01:09.940
In front of that cafe.

01:09.940 --> 01:12.943
We were talking about hitting up
another spot there... weren't we?

01:12.943 --> 01:14.116
What is this, a mystery game?

01:14.116 --> 01:17.663
Trying to patch up a bunch of blank spots
isn't going to get you anywhere.

01:25.539 --> 01:26.857
Watch it.

01:26.857 --> 01:30.992
Tae Seop. One, two. One, two.

01:30.992 --> 01:32.879
We're almost there.

01:32.879 --> 01:34.904
Hold on.

01:36.334 --> 01:38.626
God, this is driving me crazy.

01:38.626 --> 01:40.209
Maybe I should just ditch him.

01:40.209 --> 01:42.250
Please don't go without me.

01:42.250 --> 01:45.184
It's not like he's some clingy little dog...

01:45.184 --> 01:47.652
One, two, three!

01:50.030 --> 01:51.064
Hey, Lee Ui Yeong.

01:51.064 --> 01:52.766
Oh, Shin Ji Su.

01:52.766 --> 01:55.360
What are you doing here?
Aren't you supposed to be at the cafe?

01:55.360 --> 01:56.606
Wait, I have no idea.

01:56.606 --> 01:59.281
I forgot something back at the hotel.

01:59.281 --> 02:01.226
Hey, how come you're passed out
on her shoulder?

02:01.226 --> 02:03.417
- Hey!
- I'm taking him to the hotel.

02:03.417 --> 02:05.926
Wait, you two are going to a hotel like this?

02:05.926 --> 02:07.066
- Let's go.
- What?

02:07.066 --> 02:09.437
Come on, unless you'd rather
sleep out here on the street.

02:09.437 --> 02:11.334
- Give me a sec.
- Jeez.

02:11.334 --> 02:13.094
Let's go.

02:34.000 --> 02:35.417
Water...

02:35.417 --> 02:38.792
Can I get some water, please?

02:38.792 --> 02:40.955
Oh, come on.

02:54.083 --> 02:55.720
Here.

03:13.305 --> 03:15.417
- That's cold.
- Oh, seriously.

03:15.417 --> 03:16.959
This guy just keeps surprising me.

03:16.959 --> 03:19.160
It's cold.

03:29.000 --> 03:31.130
Ui Yeong, let's go.

03:34.959 --> 03:36.802
You asleep?

03:37.876 --> 03:39.805
These two together...

03:40.417 --> 03:42.266
No.

04:10.125 --> 04:12.421
It hurts.

04:36.813 --> 04:39.031
She turns into a whole different person
when she drinks.

05:06.843 --> 05:08.792
There's no way I'm leaving

05:08.792 --> 05:10.730
the two of them by themselves.

06:05.652 --> 06:09.156
[Episode 6]

06:10.615 --> 06:13.174
I'm sorry.
You couldn't even go home because of me.

06:13.174 --> 06:14.634
No, it's fine. I'm okay.

06:14.634 --> 06:16.013
Fine, my ass.

06:16.013 --> 06:19.314
Who just walks into a hotel
with some random guy...

06:19.314 --> 06:20.774
If I hadn't shown up, then what?

06:20.774 --> 06:23.209
Hey, I know I owe you one,

06:23.209 --> 06:24.671
but even if I'm a total lightweight,

06:24.671 --> 06:27.633
it doesn't make me some kind of creep.

06:27.633 --> 06:31.344
You can't even tell how much you drink,
so how can you judge how you act?

06:31.344 --> 06:33.054
What is this, summer camp?

06:33.054 --> 06:34.626
Summer camp?

06:34.626 --> 06:35.891
That's enough.

06:35.891 --> 06:37.304
Quit giving him a hard time.

06:37.304 --> 06:40.903
If nothing went wrong, then just drop it.

06:42.772 --> 06:43.999
Alright,

06:43.999 --> 06:47.026
I'd better head out
before the morning shift gets here.

06:47.026 --> 06:48.420
Why don't you clean up first?

06:48.420 --> 06:49.501
I mean, you guys spent
the whole night in the same room.

06:49.501 --> 06:51.031
Hey!

06:52.291 --> 06:55.410
The employee showers
are actually pretty decent.

06:55.410 --> 06:56.416
Alright.

06:56.416 --> 06:57.921
Better get out of here
before it gets complicated.

06:57.921 --> 06:59.180
Sure.

06:59.180 --> 07:01.083
Wait.

07:01.083 --> 07:02.500
Oh, I almost forgot.

07:02.500 --> 07:03.808
Thank you.

07:03.808 --> 07:05.461
I'm really embarrassed about all this.

07:05.461 --> 07:07.769
Could I buy you dinner this weekend
to make it up to you?

07:07.769 --> 07:10.208
Anything you want, it's on me.

07:11.133 --> 07:12.328
Sounds good.

07:12.328 --> 07:15.308
Would Saturday work for you?

07:15.308 --> 07:16.968
Sure, a meal sounds nice.

07:16.968 --> 07:20.184
And if you want to thank me,
skip the words and just feed me.

07:20.184 --> 07:21.789
Your debt to me just keeps piling up.

07:21.789 --> 07:24.834
I'll treat you. That's what I just said.

07:24.834 --> 07:27.709
- I'll send you the details by text.
- Got it.

07:27.709 --> 07:29.916
- Have a good day at work.
- Yeah.

07:29.916 --> 07:31.667
I'm off.

07:31.667 --> 07:33.330
Alright.

07:38.708 --> 07:40.416
I can't believe this, I really can't.

07:40.416 --> 07:41.956
What if somebody caught that?

07:41.956 --> 07:43.965
Seriously.

08:01.100 --> 08:02.859
Wait a minute.

08:03.958 --> 08:06.154
Isn't it suspiciously peaceful?

08:12.945 --> 08:16.123
She didn't cause me any trouble
for her entire twenties.

08:17.575 --> 08:20.286
She's really testing me now.

08:20.286 --> 08:24.386
I've burned through all my energy
and it's barely morning.

08:24.386 --> 08:27.175
Maybe I need some coffee.

08:28.586 --> 08:30.345
What's this?

08:32.214 --> 08:35.254
[A little pick-me-up just for you, Hyun Min]

08:39.458 --> 08:42.441
Always so sweet, Jung Hyun Min.

09:10.529 --> 09:11.545
Lee Ui Yeong.

09:11.545 --> 09:12.797
Where are you?

09:12.797 --> 09:14.215
Letting me know ahead of time
if you're staying out

09:14.215 --> 09:16.760
is common courtesy as a roommate, right?

09:16.760 --> 09:20.437
No reply by 9 and I'm reporting you missing.

09:21.500 --> 09:24.016
The project launched
and we went out to celebrate,

09:24.016 --> 09:26.811
but it went on forever
so I crashed in the rest area.

09:26.811 --> 09:28.695
I'm sorry.

10:06.684 --> 10:08.693
You're using my towel.

10:12.625 --> 10:13.733
So

10:13.733 --> 10:16.399
you spent the whole night keeping tabs on us?

10:16.399 --> 10:18.640
Doesn't that seem like it crossed
a line for someone just being nice?

10:18.640 --> 10:22.374
The one who went too far is you,
passing out drunk on a woman.

10:23.284 --> 10:25.260
What kind of guy gets knocked out that easily?

10:25.260 --> 10:27.019
Stop trying to dodge the point.

10:27.019 --> 10:30.000
I don't like how you keep circling
around Ui Yeong.

10:30.000 --> 10:32.759
It looks like you're just waiting
for your chance, pretending to care.

10:32.759 --> 10:34.941
Circling around?

10:34.941 --> 10:37.041
Someone as hopeless as you

10:37.041 --> 10:38.861
wouldn't recognize an opening
if it hit you in the face.

10:38.861 --> 10:40.600
Hopeless?

10:56.109 --> 10:58.642
Wait, this isn't what you think.
There's a reason for all this.

10:58.642 --> 11:00.613
I saw nothing.

11:00.613 --> 11:02.946
I don't need the details of your personal life.

11:02.946 --> 11:04.200
I really need to clear this up.

11:04.200 --> 11:05.472
Manager. Wait, please.

11:05.472 --> 11:07.875
This is all a big mix-up.

11:07.875 --> 11:09.671
Oh, for crying out loud.

11:15.250 --> 11:19.491
Nothing stays private in this hotel.

11:19.491 --> 11:21.291
The employees who spotted them are saying

11:21.291 --> 11:25.722
it wasn't just one man, it was actually two.

11:25.722 --> 11:28.287
That kind of lets me down, if I'm being real.

11:28.287 --> 11:29.292
How come?

11:29.292 --> 11:31.478
Dating more than one person at once

11:31.478 --> 11:32.854
has nothing to do with love.

11:32.854 --> 11:36.041
Who says you can't enjoy yourself
and be in love at the same time?

11:36.041 --> 11:37.792
Think about it, Sae Byeok.

11:37.792 --> 11:40.732
People these days are so judgmental
and closed off.

11:40.732 --> 11:43.251
It's all black and white.
If it's not love, it's wrong.

11:43.251 --> 11:45.157
So everyone ends up doing things
behind closed doors,

11:45.157 --> 11:49.078
then they get exposed
and it all blows up in their face, right?

11:49.078 --> 11:50.375
Ui Yeong.

11:50.375 --> 11:52.428
When did you get here?

11:52.428 --> 11:55.375
Just now. I just got here.

11:55.375 --> 11:57.291
Look, though...

11:57.291 --> 12:00.208
Isn't that going a little too far?

12:00.208 --> 12:03.849
You don't buy into those gossip rags, do you?

12:03.849 --> 12:05.052
Sorry?

12:05.052 --> 12:07.930
Gossip about what?

12:07.930 --> 12:09.250
Despite being in her 50s,

12:09.250 --> 12:12.988
Ms. S remains unchallenged
as the reigning Queen of Romance.

12:12.988 --> 12:14.895
Once said to be married to her craft,

12:14.895 --> 12:18.318
it turns out she's been wrapped up
in actual romance lately.

12:18.318 --> 12:19.692
Sources claim she's living

12:19.692 --> 12:22.166
with surgeon A,
a former affair turned domestic partner,

12:22.166 --> 12:24.655
while also seeing director B secretly
at a high-end hotel,

12:24.655 --> 12:26.375
and financially supporting model C
on top of all that.

12:26.375 --> 12:28.208
Given her extensive list of romantic interests,

12:28.208 --> 12:31.041
this story is only going to get bigger.

12:31.041 --> 12:33.208
The Queen of Romance...

12:33.208 --> 12:34.958
That has to be actress Son Jeong A, right?

12:34.958 --> 12:37.084
They might as well have just said her name.

12:37.084 --> 12:39.795
I heard she booked a room
at our hotel not long ago.

12:39.795 --> 12:41.583
Are you serious?

12:41.583 --> 12:43.250
That makes our hotel

12:43.250 --> 12:45.600
the secret meeting spot.

12:56.506 --> 12:57.542
Hey,

12:57.542 --> 12:59.416
Director Jin said

12:59.416 --> 13:01.306
he won't be at today's meeting.

13:01.306 --> 13:04.136
He just got married and doesn't want
people getting the wrong idea.

13:05.546 --> 13:07.667
So it's only for today?

13:07.667 --> 13:09.708
Or is he cutting me from the movie altogether?

13:09.708 --> 13:11.368
The thing is...

13:11.368 --> 13:13.492
What a wimp.

13:13.492 --> 13:14.507
Tell him to forget it.

13:14.507 --> 13:15.874
Let's just eat and head back.

13:15.874 --> 13:17.086
Take a seat.

13:17.086 --> 13:18.591
Okay.

13:22.088 --> 13:23.130
Excuse me,

13:23.130 --> 13:25.890
I'm Kim Min Seong from Star E.

13:26.577 --> 13:29.777
Any reason you've stayed silent
on the tabloid story?

13:29.777 --> 13:32.717
Speaking too soon would only make things worse.

13:32.717 --> 13:34.304
A statement's coming shortly.

13:34.304 --> 13:35.309
However, Mr. Kim,

13:35.309 --> 13:37.815
this is a private setting, so following me here

13:37.815 --> 13:39.689
isn't appropriate.

13:39.689 --> 13:42.484
What? I can't believe you people!

13:44.041 --> 13:45.817
Dong Hoon!

13:45.817 --> 13:48.076
Call 119, please.

13:48.076 --> 13:50.268
Here we have a single larva.

13:50.268 --> 13:51.325
In its quest to reach maturity,

13:51.325 --> 13:53.912
if you trace the molted layers it left behind,

13:53.912 --> 13:55.166
following one last shedding,

13:55.166 --> 13:56.789
it has burrowed into its duvet chrysalis

13:56.789 --> 14:00.750
and achieved complete pupal form.

14:00.750 --> 14:03.296
Stop messing around.

14:03.296 --> 14:06.556
The chrysalis is at last
undergoing transformation.

14:06.556 --> 14:09.157
Seriously though,
will I ever feel normal again?

14:09.157 --> 14:12.542
I think my entire body just shut down.

14:12.542 --> 14:14.161
Come on, get up already.

14:25.437 --> 14:27.478
It's not just your first hangover.

14:27.478 --> 14:29.537
It's your first time recovering from one, too.

14:31.281 --> 14:34.298
I wouldn't have a word to say
if she never talked to me again.

14:34.298 --> 14:35.738
This is insane.

14:35.738 --> 14:37.958
I barely had a chance
to make a good impression,

14:37.958 --> 14:39.958
and I just had to go drink
more than I could take.

14:39.958 --> 14:41.977
What's done is done, dude.

14:41.977 --> 14:44.297
Ui Yeong was wasted too, wasn't she?

14:44.297 --> 14:47.834
She's most likely
freaking out just as much. Relax.

14:47.834 --> 14:49.498
What a waste, hey.

14:49.498 --> 14:50.806
Why aren't

14:50.806 --> 14:55.396
you eating any of these dishes
your mom put together for you?

14:56.015 --> 14:58.299
You've got plans with Ui Yeong
this Saturday, don't you?

14:58.299 --> 15:00.599
That's great.

15:00.599 --> 15:02.605
Replace the old flame with a fresh face,

15:02.605 --> 15:04.473
wash down the hangover with a bowl of broth,

15:04.473 --> 15:07.500
and bury those ugly memories
under brand new ones.

15:07.500 --> 15:08.861
Gosh,

15:08.861 --> 15:11.363
this really hits the spot.

15:11.363 --> 15:13.500
So what's the plan?

15:13.500 --> 15:14.542
Well...

15:14.542 --> 15:16.369
I'm thinking a nice dinner with her,

15:16.369 --> 15:19.247
and we'll catch a movie we haven't seen.

15:19.247 --> 15:20.720
So everything's already figured out?

15:20.720 --> 15:23.341
Not even close. I'm only getting started.

15:24.583 --> 15:26.250
I have to make that whole drunk disaster

15:26.250 --> 15:28.388
completely disappear from her memory.

15:32.342 --> 15:34.011
I'm not leaving

15:34.011 --> 15:37.347
until Son Jeong A shows her face today.

15:37.347 --> 15:38.999
Can you see?

15:38.999 --> 15:41.943
Man, the press is swarming out here.

15:43.625 --> 15:45.613
This is a mess.

15:47.458 --> 15:48.961
So much for going home.

15:48.961 --> 15:50.310
[Son Jeong A's mystery lovers, A, B, C]
For those kinds of prices,

15:50.310 --> 15:51.972
they could keep things private.

15:51.972 --> 15:54.414
There's just way too many famous people
in that building.

15:55.542 --> 15:57.250
Given how crazy everything is right now,

15:57.250 --> 15:59.426
riding around with you in my car
isn't really an option,

15:59.426 --> 16:02.255
so lay low here for the time being.

16:03.333 --> 16:05.292
Lately, the strategy is
to lock in your concept,

16:05.292 --> 16:07.377
put together all your evidence,
and hit them with

16:07.377 --> 16:11.708
a single well-planned feature piece
that says it all.

16:11.708 --> 16:13.345
Yeah.

16:13.345 --> 16:15.166
Sure beats chasing

16:15.166 --> 16:17.193
after every low-quality hit piece
that comes out.

16:17.193 --> 16:18.598
It's not like I'm some
twenty- or thirty-something.

16:18.598 --> 16:20.857
I've got nothing left to lose.

16:21.790 --> 16:24.708
Look into journalists who can
tell my side properly.

16:24.708 --> 16:26.375
Covering up a love scandal

16:26.375 --> 16:29.208
by telling an even greater love story.

16:29.208 --> 16:30.485
Brilliant, truly brilliant.

16:30.485 --> 16:31.551
Pardon me,

16:31.551 --> 16:33.991
the press has zero access
to this area, correct?

16:33.991 --> 16:35.955
Please don't worry.

16:36.625 --> 16:38.375
Well then,

16:38.375 --> 16:39.576
I was wondering...

16:39.576 --> 16:42.914
are you familiar with what we call GRO?

16:42.914 --> 16:43.982
No.

16:43.982 --> 16:44.998
What's that?

16:44.998 --> 16:46.917
In a nutshell,

16:46.917 --> 16:49.962
it's like having a dedicated assistant
for everything during your visit.

16:49.962 --> 16:51.046
While you're with us,

16:51.046 --> 16:53.333
we could pair you
with a staff member who handles

16:53.333 --> 16:56.678
your schedule and shopping needs.

16:56.678 --> 16:58.157
That sounds great!

16:58.157 --> 17:00.638
Make sure she's a woman with good taste.

17:00.638 --> 17:03.137
Of course, let me find someone.

17:03.137 --> 17:04.755
I'll take my leave.

17:09.875 --> 17:11.958
- Gosh.
- It will work out this time.

17:11.958 --> 17:12.985
Have you read that piece yet?

17:12.985 --> 17:15.356
[Final candidate for HKUH Director]

17:20.616 --> 17:23.453
All day long, every corner I turned,
people were talking about you.

17:23.453 --> 17:25.016
And look who decided to show up in person.

17:25.016 --> 17:28.116
Somehow you landed in a tabloid
rather than a research publication.

17:28.116 --> 17:29.708
Oh, is that so?

17:29.708 --> 17:32.125
Honestly, even just being vice director

17:32.125 --> 17:34.256
already seemed too generous,

17:34.256 --> 17:35.924
but everyone kept pressuring me
to go for director

17:35.924 --> 17:37.750
because of what it would mean
for the hospital's image,

17:37.750 --> 17:39.971
and they just wouldn't let up...

17:39.971 --> 17:42.139
Now it makes sense
why everyone was acting strange,

17:42.139 --> 17:44.565
so this is what's behind it.

17:45.542 --> 17:46.667
But

17:46.667 --> 17:48.750
rumors really do make
for good entertainment, don't they?

17:48.750 --> 17:52.357
A man of your schedule,
showing up for a little gossip...

17:52.357 --> 17:54.208
Standing in the corridor
gushing like schoolchildren.

17:54.208 --> 17:56.948
Judging by how thrilled you look,

17:56.948 --> 17:59.372
it must be quite the topic.

18:00.625 --> 18:03.376
I've got a surgery to get to, so excuse me.

18:06.039 --> 18:08.339
Doors are closing.

18:16.173 --> 18:17.690
[Son Jeong A]

18:23.965 --> 18:26.785
So, did everything go smoothly at check-in?

18:26.785 --> 18:28.667
That story caught my eye.

18:28.667 --> 18:30.646
Right, about that...

18:30.646 --> 18:32.083
Being with someone of your stature,

18:32.083 --> 18:35.785
I always knew it wouldn't be simple.

18:35.785 --> 18:37.994
Should I come to the hotel this weekend?

19:10.144 --> 19:11.159
Hey, Mom!

19:11.159 --> 19:13.112
No dinner yet, right?

19:17.041 --> 19:18.638
What is all this?

19:18.638 --> 19:20.328
Surprise!

19:22.458 --> 19:24.540
It looks so good.

19:29.041 --> 19:31.138
Pretty impressive cooking skills, right?

19:31.138 --> 19:33.759
Grown-up or not,
at least sleep under your own roof.

19:33.759 --> 19:36.696
One more time
and every single lock code is getting reset.

19:36.696 --> 19:39.077
You're contradicting yourself, you know that?

19:39.077 --> 19:42.176
When you miss me, just be sweet about it.

19:42.176 --> 19:44.577
There's a mountain of recycling
and the balcony reeks.

19:44.577 --> 19:46.337
Nobody touched the washing machine,
so no clean towels left.

19:46.337 --> 19:47.797
Plus, zero eggs in the fridge.

19:47.797 --> 19:49.477
Oh, so this is all about housework.

19:49.477 --> 19:51.717
Look, I already tossed the trash
and scrubbed every floor.

19:51.717 --> 19:52.797
Lay off the booze.

19:52.797 --> 19:56.357
Back in the day, you always stumbled home
no matter how drunk you were.

19:56.357 --> 19:57.617
Right? That does sound like me.

19:57.617 --> 20:00.326
My internal GPS is solid,
so how did that happen...

20:03.958 --> 20:05.998
You can't leave.

20:08.118 --> 20:10.336
What's wrong? That's creepy.

20:15.168 --> 20:16.294
What?

20:16.294 --> 20:17.503
- Huh?
- What?

20:17.503 --> 20:18.715
- What?
- What?

20:18.715 --> 20:19.750
What?

20:19.750 --> 20:22.014
No!

20:23.458 --> 20:26.978
Someone's busy piecing the night back together.

20:38.625 --> 20:40.867
The aroma is already amazing.

20:41.500 --> 20:43.792
- Nice, right?
- Yes.

20:43.792 --> 20:46.038
- Thank you.
- Sure.

20:46.907 --> 20:50.208
What I'm getting at is...

20:50.208 --> 20:52.079
It'd be great if you could handle

20:52.079 --> 20:54.748
the GRO role for actress Son Jeong A.

20:54.748 --> 20:56.875
Doesn't that kind of thing

20:56.875 --> 20:58.677
normally fall under the concierge department?

20:58.677 --> 21:02.296
There's no set playbook for GRO at our hotel.

21:02.296 --> 21:05.497
Figure out your own way
to connect with the guest

21:05.497 --> 21:08.682
and deliver the best experience possible.

21:08.682 --> 21:13.166
Am I really the right person for this?

21:13.166 --> 21:15.402
Remember that thing I tell you all the time?

21:15.402 --> 21:17.583
Great hospitality isn't born

21:17.583 --> 21:19.169
out of expertise.

21:19.169 --> 21:21.866
It comes from sincerity.

21:23.166 --> 21:25.369
I know you've got this.

21:27.375 --> 21:29.825
Shopping is a big chunk of it, sure,

21:29.825 --> 21:31.993
but, beyond that...

21:31.993 --> 21:35.882
everyone's been really harsh on her lately,

21:35.882 --> 21:37.791
and you're a fan of Son Jeong A.

21:37.791 --> 21:39.250
In moments like these, a friendly face nearby

21:39.250 --> 21:42.671
could really make a difference.

21:42.671 --> 21:45.884
Here's your shot at being the ultimate fan.

21:48.166 --> 21:49.859
Understood.

21:49.859 --> 21:51.519
Good.

21:51.519 --> 21:53.416
The essentials are covered on my end,

21:53.416 --> 21:57.060
but do some digging to see
if there's anything else she wants

21:57.060 --> 21:58.540
- and get it prepared.
- Will do.

21:58.540 --> 22:00.522
For anything you're unsure about,

22:00.522 --> 22:02.692
this is the business card
for Son Jeong A's manager.

22:02.692 --> 22:05.409
Give him a call.

22:08.369 --> 22:09.958
That said,

22:09.958 --> 22:13.583
keep it professional.

22:13.583 --> 22:16.250
Right, absolutely.

22:16.250 --> 22:17.922
Sure.

22:29.259 --> 22:32.061
["Queen of Romance for 20 years now,"
every moment feels like the final one]

22:37.392 --> 22:38.935
[Never misses a chance to read while traveling]

22:38.935 --> 22:40.312
[Marguerite Duras]
[The Lover]

22:40.312 --> 22:42.439
[Wine and chocolate]

22:42.439 --> 22:44.603
[Vinyl Bill Evans jazz records]

22:50.030 --> 22:55.626
["Nothing Without Love?"
Backlash over Son Jeong A's acceptance speech]

22:57.103 --> 22:58.875
Acting and loving are the two moments

22:58.875 --> 23:00.778
where I feel truly alive,

23:00.778 --> 23:04.836
and not once have I felt embarrassed by it.

23:04.836 --> 23:07.834
Without love, I'm practically lifeless,

23:07.834 --> 23:09.591
so all that passion is something

23:09.591 --> 23:12.340
I plan to channel
into my craft for years to come.

23:12.340 --> 23:14.228
Thank you.

23:18.183 --> 23:19.184
[48th Seoul Film Awards]

23:19.184 --> 23:21.813
[Best Actress, Son Jeong A]

23:21.813 --> 23:24.155
Congratulations.

23:27.097 --> 23:31.412
Now I get why people made such a fuss.

23:34.284 --> 23:35.660
Oh, you scared me.

23:35.660 --> 23:37.841
When did you all show up?

23:37.841 --> 23:41.220
So caring about her juniors
doesn't qualify as love?

23:41.220 --> 23:44.481
Careful you don't flip from fangirl to hater.

23:44.481 --> 23:46.045
Word on the street is

23:46.045 --> 23:47.964
she exclusively talks to guys.

23:47.964 --> 23:49.792
- What?
- What?

23:49.792 --> 23:51.682
No way...

23:55.458 --> 23:58.100
Shouldn't you all be working?

23:58.100 --> 24:00.381
Talking about celebrities
is entertaining, right?

24:00.381 --> 24:02.341
Highlight of my entire day, honestly.

24:02.341 --> 24:04.708
Off to do my actual job now.

24:04.708 --> 24:07.061
Actually, there's something I need to bring up.

24:07.061 --> 24:09.359
Apparently one of the pop-up shelves
is rattling,

24:09.359 --> 24:11.242
want me to reach out to HOME
about getting it repaired?

24:11.242 --> 24:13.788
- Yeah, please do.
- Sure.

24:19.250 --> 24:22.881
I heard the soup uses seasonal ingredients.

24:22.881 --> 24:24.681
Oh, green peas?

24:24.681 --> 24:26.125
Got it.

24:26.125 --> 24:28.501
Party of two on the 2nd, 5:30 p.m.

24:28.501 --> 24:32.101
Somewhere peaceful where we can talk, please.

24:32.101 --> 24:34.183
Yes, thank you.

24:35.637 --> 24:40.398
Looks like a 46% rain forecast
for the afternoon.

24:41.349 --> 24:43.059
Might as well pack an umbrella to be safe.

24:43.059 --> 24:46.557
[2nd, 5:30 p.m., party of two, peas, umbrella]

24:47.416 --> 24:49.750
Scroll up a little.

24:49.750 --> 24:52.416
What is he up to?

24:52.416 --> 24:54.780
Beats me, did he take on something new?

24:54.780 --> 24:57.909
Let's just say this might be the biggest
undertaking of his life.

24:57.909 --> 25:01.473
By the way, pack up some tools
and make a trip to the hotel.

25:01.473 --> 25:03.914
One of the display units over there seems off.

25:03.914 --> 25:06.434
Do a full inspection of everything
while you're at it.

25:06.434 --> 25:08.175
Let me...

25:10.333 --> 25:12.514
- I'll go.
- Seriously, you?

25:12.514 --> 25:15.675
We'd be super grateful
if you're actually going yourself.

25:15.675 --> 25:17.375
Sure.

25:17.375 --> 25:19.395
Safe travels.

25:20.041 --> 25:21.939
So we're off the hook?

25:36.336 --> 25:37.436
Ui Yeong.

25:37.436 --> 25:39.291
Oh, Tae Seop.

25:39.291 --> 25:42.476
- Did you make the trip in person?
- Yeah.

25:42.476 --> 25:43.816
Everything good with you?

25:43.816 --> 25:45.256
Yeah.

25:45.256 --> 25:47.516
Actress Son Jeong A,
you know who she is, right?

25:47.516 --> 25:48.537
Of course.

25:48.537 --> 25:50.583
They put me in charge of her hotel experience,

25:50.583 --> 25:52.357
something like that.

25:52.357 --> 25:54.837
Oh, really? She's your favorite, isn't she?

25:54.837 --> 25:57.536
Right, which is exactly
why my nerves are a wreck.

25:57.536 --> 25:58.999
All day I've been digging through every article

25:58.999 --> 26:01.836
and scrolling through her posts
like it's homework.

26:01.836 --> 26:04.875
Her socials.

26:04.875 --> 26:07.041
Do you have one too?

26:07.041 --> 26:08.778
Yeah.

26:10.397 --> 26:12.901
Where do I even tap?

26:12.901 --> 26:16.438
It feels like I'm peeking
into Ui Yeong's drawer.

26:16.438 --> 26:19.288
Oh, she likes food.

26:23.792 --> 26:25.371
Gosh, look at you.

26:25.371 --> 26:28.833
You're absolutely glued
to someone else's profile.

26:28.833 --> 26:32.375
Her job is mostly
sourcing ingredients for the hotel,

26:32.375 --> 26:34.625
so there's a good chance she's already tried

26:34.625 --> 26:36.256
just about every decent spot in Seoul.

26:36.256 --> 26:39.999
An ordinary place isn't going to impress her.

26:39.999 --> 26:42.813
Maybe I need to change the reservation.

26:42.813 --> 26:46.235
Put the phone away
and pay attention to this for a sec.

26:46.235 --> 26:49.174
- It won't stop scraping against the ground.
- Sure.

26:49.174 --> 26:50.353
Could you step aside, please?

26:50.353 --> 26:51.542
Step aside?

26:51.542 --> 26:53.333
Wasn't this some pricey piece

26:53.333 --> 26:55.055
of marble shipped in from Italy?

26:55.055 --> 26:57.153
Exactly. Hold it right here like this.

26:57.153 --> 26:59.203
- Like this?
- Yeah.

27:05.416 --> 27:07.958
Perfect, that does it.

27:07.958 --> 27:09.667
Can't contain yourself

27:09.667 --> 27:11.751
thinking about the date with her?

27:11.751 --> 27:14.339
A first date is a once-in-a-lifetime thing.

27:14.339 --> 27:18.097
Planning everything out has me all giddy.

27:59.215 --> 28:00.984
[Pleased to have you, enjoy a relaxing time]

28:06.169 --> 28:07.973
Looks like it's all set.

28:07.973 --> 28:09.017
Well...

28:09.017 --> 28:11.233
Except for one last piece.

28:18.341 --> 28:20.458
My name's Lee Ui Yeong,
and I'll be looking after you

28:20.458 --> 28:22.745
for the length of your visit.

28:23.984 --> 28:24.990
Nice to meet you.

28:24.990 --> 28:26.790
I'm Son Jeong A.

28:27.769 --> 28:31.879
Take a look around, and just say the word
if something's missing.

28:37.658 --> 28:41.096
Wait, I'm in the middle of this exact book.

28:41.756 --> 28:44.618
[Love]
It's one of your favorite authors, right?

28:44.618 --> 28:47.512
I got it because the new edition just came out,

28:47.512 --> 28:49.418
but it looks like I was a step behind.

28:49.418 --> 28:52.327
I bought it the day it dropped.

28:56.773 --> 28:59.618
Most hotels go with real flowers,

28:59.618 --> 29:02.458
so this picture frame was intentional?

29:02.458 --> 29:04.571
Since you're allergic to pollen.

29:04.571 --> 29:06.597
["Nothing Without Love?"
Backlash over Son Jeong A's acceptance speech]

29:15.290 --> 29:18.120
[Allergic to pollen?]

29:20.031 --> 29:23.542
Nobody's heard me bring it up
since I hate sounding high-maintenance,

29:23.542 --> 29:25.933
but you figured it out on your own.

29:30.288 --> 29:31.939
So then,

29:32.542 --> 29:35.051
what's your take on all the gossip?

29:35.051 --> 29:36.471
Think any of it's true?

29:36.471 --> 29:38.625
Well, I...

29:38.625 --> 29:43.075
Between A, B, and C,
which one feels like true love?

29:46.323 --> 29:48.041
From where I stand,

29:48.041 --> 29:50.910
my priority is making certain

29:50.910 --> 29:53.661
that you get all the rest
and comfort you deserve

29:53.661 --> 29:56.403
while you're our guest.

29:56.403 --> 29:57.876
The general manager

29:57.876 --> 30:00.960
picked a truly sharp one for me.

30:00.960 --> 30:02.323
I'm counting on you.

30:02.323 --> 30:04.383
Thank you.

30:04.383 --> 30:05.715
Also, one more thing.

30:05.715 --> 30:07.704
Two coffees a day is non-negotiable for me.

30:07.704 --> 30:10.011
The coffee they serve here is
way too harsh for my taste, though,

30:10.011 --> 30:12.807
so could you get me beans with some acidity?

30:12.807 --> 30:16.124
A medium roast should do the trick.

30:16.124 --> 30:18.811
Also, some extra sets of sleepwear
would be great,

30:18.811 --> 30:20.345
plus an additional humidifier.

30:20.345 --> 30:22.322
Sure, I'll take care of it.

30:25.276 --> 30:27.614
[Light-medium roast with a hint of acidity]

30:27.614 --> 30:30.742
Drip bags, bright acidity, okay.

30:30.742 --> 30:33.042
Need to hurry before they close up.

30:39.709 --> 30:42.587
Last call, we're about to shut down.

30:42.587 --> 30:43.667
Hey.

30:43.667 --> 30:45.345
Bro.

30:58.518 --> 31:01.553
Since when does a scrappy theater director
drink whiskey?

31:01.553 --> 31:03.399
Did you come here for a reason?

31:03.399 --> 31:05.073
Busted.

31:06.542 --> 31:09.488
That performance on Saturday, you know the one.

31:09.488 --> 31:10.513
Yeah.

31:10.513 --> 31:12.282
I heard you're putting on a show

31:12.282 --> 31:14.673
for the Seungbo Group staff,
your theater sponsor.

31:14.673 --> 31:17.291
Get on that stage for me.

31:17.291 --> 31:18.999
Se Hyun

31:18.999 --> 31:21.772
went back home because her mom's sick.

31:21.772 --> 31:23.831
What's wrong with her?

31:23.831 --> 31:25.886
Yeah, it's pretty serious.

31:29.166 --> 31:31.351
Then I'll see you at rehearsal tomorrow.

31:31.351 --> 31:32.352
Leaving already?

31:32.352 --> 31:33.388
Yeah.

31:33.388 --> 31:35.479
This drink isn't going down right.

31:38.041 --> 31:40.651
Alright, get home safe.

31:45.232 --> 31:47.192
We're officially shutting down...

31:47.192 --> 31:48.785
Any chance I could grab some drip bags?

31:48.785 --> 31:50.164
The kind with a fruity tang.

31:50.164 --> 31:52.538
Yeah, come on in.

31:58.296 --> 31:59.425
Have you been stuck at the office all day?

31:59.425 --> 32:01.922
Yeah, things really piled up.

32:04.166 --> 32:06.176
Feeling snacky at all?

32:10.583 --> 32:14.309
Mom, I worked late
and I'm grabbing a bite before I come home.

32:15.862 --> 32:17.371
Here.

32:17.371 --> 32:19.599
I'm not drinking for a while.

32:19.599 --> 32:20.771
How come?

32:20.771 --> 32:22.562
There's work in the morning,

32:22.562 --> 32:25.194
plus mom's been keeping
an eye on me these days.

32:31.166 --> 32:33.752
Are we even allowed to snack like this in here?

32:33.752 --> 32:34.951
Totally fine.

32:34.951 --> 32:36.071
How about some tunes?

32:36.071 --> 32:38.125
Sounds perfect.

32:38.871 --> 32:40.661
It pays to know someone at a cafe.

32:40.661 --> 32:41.917
[A Season Called You]

33:02.208 --> 33:03.435
Hey.

33:03.435 --> 33:05.842
I'm knocking one meal off my tab with this.

33:05.842 --> 33:08.208
Only two more to go.

33:08.208 --> 33:10.241
You're really keeping count. So petty.

33:10.241 --> 33:13.111
Compared to everything I've done,
this barely registers.

33:13.111 --> 33:15.416
For someone saying that,
you sure seem to be enjoying it.

33:15.416 --> 33:17.039
You've got some sauce there.

33:18.041 --> 33:19.117
Plus,

33:19.117 --> 33:20.882
it's not like anyone forced you to jump in.

33:20.882 --> 33:24.963
Volunteering first
and then billing me in food is pretty low.

33:25.625 --> 33:27.183
Well, that's...

33:27.183 --> 33:28.185
Fair point.

33:29.981 --> 33:32.554
You've got some on you, too.

33:35.375 --> 33:39.049
Minding my own business is kind of my thing,

33:39.049 --> 33:41.480
yet somehow your stuff always pulls me in.

33:43.625 --> 33:45.359
See?

33:52.958 --> 33:54.011
Hey.

33:54.011 --> 33:57.613
Talk like that in front of other people
and they'll read into it.

33:57.613 --> 34:00.207
Seriously, your concept
of personal space is wild.

34:01.375 --> 34:03.585
Call it a misunderstanding if you want,

34:04.871 --> 34:07.172
but maybe some of it isn't so far off.

34:09.085 --> 34:10.759
What?

34:12.333 --> 34:15.796
It seems like you keep treating me
like just anybody,

34:15.796 --> 34:18.375
but whether I was
a last-minute stand-in or not,

34:18.375 --> 34:20.720
the two of us did go on that date.

34:20.720 --> 34:23.433
Things have been building between us.

34:23.433 --> 34:27.416
Every moment with you has been a good time,

34:27.416 --> 34:29.236
or am I the only one who feels that way?

34:32.025 --> 34:33.573
What?

34:35.408 --> 34:37.916
Don't overthink it.

34:37.916 --> 34:39.530
All I'm saying is...

34:39.530 --> 34:42.624
my days have been way more interesting
since you came around.

34:43.250 --> 34:44.470
Just keep eating.

34:44.470 --> 34:46.829
Take your time digesting that.

34:46.829 --> 34:48.755
Oh, man.

35:00.618 --> 35:02.041
How are you getting home?

35:02.041 --> 35:03.152
I called a cab.

35:03.152 --> 35:05.056
It'll be here soon.

35:05.056 --> 35:07.816
I've got to head to rehearsal too.

35:09.250 --> 35:11.250
- Go home safe.
- Yeah.

35:11.250 --> 35:13.125
Let's grab a meal again later.

35:13.125 --> 35:15.324
Sure, take care.

35:20.333 --> 35:21.997
Bye.

35:40.875 --> 35:43.268
What was that, all of a sudden?

35:43.887 --> 35:47.606
Since when is "I enjoy your company"
not the same as "I have feelings for you"?

35:52.416 --> 35:53.792
[Song Tae Seop]

35:53.792 --> 35:55.275
You did great today.

35:55.275 --> 35:57.600
I can't wait for the weekend to get here.

35:57.600 --> 35:59.534
Good night.

36:04.059 --> 36:05.307
Thank you.

36:05.307 --> 36:07.048
Good night to you too, Tae Seop.

36:07.048 --> 36:09.127
See you soon.

36:17.125 --> 36:18.667
- Come in.
- Okay.

36:18.667 --> 36:20.756
- Let me take this call.
- Sure.

36:20.756 --> 36:22.291
Yeah.

36:22.291 --> 36:24.309
What do you mean, casting?

36:25.387 --> 36:27.558
Who told you to go ahead
and pull that off on your own?

36:27.558 --> 36:30.577
It's just a show for the staff.

36:30.577 --> 36:32.667
I'm the wife of a group chairman,

36:32.667 --> 36:33.858
and I can't even sponsor it?

36:33.858 --> 36:36.357
Drop it. I can't go.

36:36.357 --> 36:38.677
Dr. Shin is coming tomorrow.

36:38.677 --> 36:41.817
I've got a ton of stuff to sort out with him.

36:41.817 --> 36:42.818
My head is spinning.

36:42.818 --> 36:44.498
For now, shoot me the location.

36:44.498 --> 36:46.957
Yeah, okay, I'll send it.

36:50.330 --> 36:51.495
So the thing is,

36:51.495 --> 36:55.042
- I have a small favor to run by you.
- Of course, what is it?

36:55.042 --> 36:56.542
I'll send you the address,

36:56.542 --> 36:58.797
so could you deliver
a flower basket there tomorrow?

36:58.797 --> 37:02.597
It's an important performance,
but I can't make it.

37:03.708 --> 37:05.872
Also,

37:05.872 --> 37:06.903
take this card with you.

37:06.903 --> 37:07.935
Got it.

37:07.935 --> 37:09.013
No need to stay for the performance.

37:09.013 --> 37:10.958
Just drop off the flowers.

37:10.958 --> 37:12.002
Of course, no problem.

37:12.002 --> 37:14.875
Also, I'm planning
to have a guest over tomorrow night

37:14.875 --> 37:16.479
to share a meal.

37:16.479 --> 37:17.862
How many guests?

37:17.862 --> 37:19.146
Just one.

37:19.146 --> 37:22.568
He'll be here around 7 p.m., and for the menu,

37:22.568 --> 37:24.737
something Western that pairs well with wine.

37:24.737 --> 37:26.147
I'll leave it to you.

37:26.147 --> 37:29.387
Absolutely, everything will be set
the moment your guest walks in.

37:29.387 --> 37:30.926
He'll also be spending the night.

37:30.926 --> 37:32.947
Make sure discretion is a top priority.

37:32.947 --> 37:35.005
Absolutely, I'll see to it.

37:39.875 --> 37:41.966
Should I have bought two?

37:41.966 --> 37:43.147
Think it'll be enough?

37:43.147 --> 37:47.184
It's not like Tae Seop is
some big eater or spender.

37:49.994 --> 37:53.064
You sure he has no desires?

37:54.375 --> 37:56.276
Did we come to the wrong place?

37:58.958 --> 38:00.989
Wet wipes.

38:01.750 --> 38:03.958
Hydrogen peroxide. Band-aids.

38:03.958 --> 38:06.102
Are you going to boot camp?

38:06.102 --> 38:07.115
Blanket.

38:07.115 --> 38:09.854
This is for a date, right?

38:09.854 --> 38:13.125
Anything could come up when you're out,

38:13.125 --> 38:16.458
so it makes sense to have these on hand.

38:16.458 --> 38:18.958
Sua, put that down,
wash your hands, and come eat pizza.

38:18.958 --> 38:20.842
Sure.

38:26.680 --> 38:29.521
I've never seen anyone
prepare this hard for a date.

38:29.521 --> 38:31.540
Is this anxiety or straight-up insanity?

38:31.540 --> 38:33.640
It's pure anticipation.

38:33.640 --> 38:35.261
Dad!

38:35.261 --> 38:37.484
Look at this!

38:39.166 --> 38:40.479
A timetable.

38:40.479 --> 38:43.318
[Dinner, Coffee Time, Movie, Drive Home]

38:44.416 --> 38:46.193
This isn't a dream, right?

38:46.193 --> 38:49.663
Never believed anyone like this
was real until now.

38:50.483 --> 38:51.490
Hey Sua,

38:51.490 --> 38:55.228
once you finish eating,
mind helping me choose what to wear?

38:55.228 --> 38:57.021
Okay.

38:57.021 --> 38:59.222
Sua, I'm cooler than him, aren't I?

38:59.222 --> 39:01.792
No, he wins by a mile.

39:01.792 --> 39:03.622
That hurts!

39:03.622 --> 39:05.333
I thought I was dreaming.

39:05.333 --> 39:07.013
Look at this.

39:28.125 --> 39:29.280
Seung Jun.

39:29.280 --> 39:31.221
Don't you think it's boiling in here?

39:31.221 --> 39:33.083
That's just proof

39:33.083 --> 39:35.401
that we worked hard today.

39:35.401 --> 39:36.869
I mean, that's not the point.

39:36.869 --> 39:39.521
Pretty sure the air conditioning is dead.

39:39.521 --> 39:40.642
What are you talking about?

39:40.642 --> 39:42.841
They literally just repaired it.

39:44.375 --> 39:45.535
Wait, seriously?

39:45.535 --> 39:47.062
Not a single bit of cool air. Nothing.

39:47.062 --> 39:49.180
See? Told you.

40:03.148 --> 40:04.208
This piece of junk...

40:04.208 --> 40:06.531
The repair bills alone
cost more than a new one.

40:11.458 --> 40:13.273
Oh, hello?

40:13.273 --> 40:15.113
Oh, hi, Hyun Min.

40:15.113 --> 40:17.368
My schedule freed up early,

40:17.368 --> 40:19.393
which means I could see you
earlier than planned.

40:19.393 --> 40:21.033
Right,

40:21.033 --> 40:24.393
but our gym's AC just broke down
and it's chaos here,

40:24.393 --> 40:26.494
so I don't think I can step away right now.

40:26.494 --> 40:28.180
Gosh.

40:28.180 --> 40:30.534
Isn't it like a furnace in there
without air conditioning?

40:30.534 --> 40:32.916
Absolutely, we're practically
in a hot spring right now

40:32.916 --> 40:35.375
and honestly I might pass out from the heat.

40:35.375 --> 40:37.763
Give me a minute to handle this,

40:37.763 --> 40:39.560
then I'll reach out again.

40:39.560 --> 40:40.601
- Okay.
- I'm really sorry.

40:40.601 --> 40:42.525
No worries at all.

40:51.993 --> 40:52.994
You're hot, right?

40:52.994 --> 40:54.078
I'm so sorry.

40:54.078 --> 40:55.094
Sorry about this.

40:55.094 --> 40:56.453
Take this towel, please.

40:56.453 --> 40:58.083
Apologies, you must be melting.

40:58.083 --> 40:59.918
- Grab a towel.
- Unbearable, right?

41:01.542 --> 41:03.674
Right now it's like military training in here.

41:03.674 --> 41:05.749
- I'm so sorry.
- My clothes are drenched all the way through.

41:05.749 --> 41:07.172
I apologize.

41:07.172 --> 41:08.794
Please take it easy, it's risky in this heat.

41:08.794 --> 41:09.974
Your memberships will be extended on us.

41:09.974 --> 41:11.805
Sorry about this.

41:30.819 --> 41:32.656
Let's cool you down.

41:32.656 --> 41:34.744
Hyun Min.

41:37.575 --> 41:40.036
You must be hot. Here, have one of these.

41:40.036 --> 41:41.368
Right.

41:41.368 --> 41:43.706
What flavor can I get you?

41:43.706 --> 41:45.656
Thank you.

41:45.656 --> 41:47.125
Wait a sec.

41:47.125 --> 41:49.001
I feel like I've seen you before.

41:49.001 --> 41:49.754
Are you okay?

41:49.754 --> 41:50.750
Don't I know you from somewhere?

41:50.750 --> 41:52.583
I'm sorry.

41:52.583 --> 41:55.255
- Don't worry about your membership.
- Well...

41:55.255 --> 41:57.195
Can't say I recognize you.

41:57.195 --> 41:58.844
You're quite the smooth talker.

41:58.844 --> 42:00.375
Oh, I didn't mean that.

42:00.375 --> 42:01.875
Seriously,

42:01.875 --> 42:03.474
you're sweating way too much.

42:03.474 --> 42:05.100
Let me get you

42:05.100 --> 42:07.958
some extra towels.

42:07.958 --> 42:09.779
Right, thanks.

42:13.174 --> 42:14.360
I'll head out first.

42:14.360 --> 42:15.736
Yeah, good work today.

42:15.736 --> 42:18.667
[Closed for weekend AC repairs]

42:18.667 --> 42:21.283
Get some rest, Seung Jun.

42:21.283 --> 42:23.160
Will do.

42:23.160 --> 42:25.462
He puts his heart into everything.

42:27.125 --> 42:28.798
Here.

42:33.750 --> 42:35.694
Appreciate you coming by today.

42:35.694 --> 42:38.133
But how did you know to come?

42:38.133 --> 42:40.535
Your shirt has it plastered across the front.

42:40.535 --> 42:42.555
Deukgeun Deukgeun Gym.

42:42.555 --> 42:44.615
That whole stripping moment is
burned into my brain.

42:44.615 --> 42:47.017
Pervert.

42:47.017 --> 42:49.235
You like this pervert, though.

42:56.988 --> 42:59.254
Wait, is that one strawberry?

42:59.254 --> 43:01.080
Let me try a taste.

43:27.250 --> 43:30.693
It's still a date, so...

43:31.446 --> 43:33.446
Go with something colorful?

43:36.208 --> 43:37.586
No.

43:37.586 --> 43:40.448
Looking like I put in
too much effort would be...

43:40.448 --> 43:42.539
Such an amateur thing.

43:46.660 --> 43:48.039
Maybe a dress?

43:48.039 --> 43:50.458
A dress?

43:50.458 --> 43:52.465
How about jeans?

44:12.834 --> 44:15.316
Perfect.

44:15.316 --> 44:17.740
I look casual and cute.

44:24.040 --> 44:26.040
Thank you.

44:31.205 --> 44:33.248
- Have a wonderful time.
- Thanks.

44:33.248 --> 44:34.708
Hello.

44:34.708 --> 44:36.262
- Have a wonderful time.
- Thanks.

44:36.262 --> 44:37.103
- Hello.
- Hello.

44:37.103 --> 44:39.223
Would it be possible
to pass these flowers along?

44:39.223 --> 44:41.116
[Coat Check]
Absolutely. Leave them with me,

44:41.116 --> 44:42.834
I'll make sure
they get there once the curtain falls.

44:42.834 --> 44:44.225
And who should I bring them to?

44:44.225 --> 44:47.228
Hang on one second.

44:49.432 --> 44:50.450
[To Ji Su, congrats on the show. Need to talk]

44:50.450 --> 44:52.125
[I'm at The Hills Seoul. Come see me.
From Son Jeong A]

44:52.125 --> 44:53.444
Ji Su?

44:53.444 --> 44:56.112
Oh, you mean Shin Ji Su?

44:57.750 --> 44:59.245
Yes, Shin Ji Su.

44:59.245 --> 45:01.534
Oh, got it.

45:04.500 --> 45:07.416
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

45:07.416 --> 45:10.872
Hello, let me check your ticket.

45:10.872 --> 45:11.916
Have a wonderful time.

45:11.916 --> 45:15.125
- Thanks.
- Thanks.

45:15.125 --> 45:17.133
Thank you.

45:17.750 --> 45:19.493
[The Seagull]

45:20.671 --> 45:22.333
[The Seagull]

45:22.333 --> 45:24.925
Wait, Son Jeong A and Shin Ji Su

45:24.925 --> 45:27.500
are actually connected?

45:27.500 --> 45:29.604
Could it be...

45:34.768 --> 45:38.143
[The queen's long list of men]

45:39.192 --> 45:40.649
Sources claim she's living

45:40.649 --> 45:43.083
with surgeon A,
a former affair turned domestic partner,

45:43.083 --> 45:45.529
while also seeing director B
secretly at a high-end hotel,

45:45.529 --> 45:48.331
and financially supporting model C
on top of all that.

45:49.075 --> 45:50.111
[She bankrolled Model C]

45:50.111 --> 45:52.460
[With her long history of flings,
this scandal is just the beginning]

46:19.041 --> 46:21.234
Ui Yeong.

46:21.234 --> 46:23.361
New hairstyle?

46:23.361 --> 46:25.083
Where are your glasses?

46:25.083 --> 46:26.654
I put in a little effort.

46:26.654 --> 46:29.073
It's our first date.

46:30.073 --> 46:33.079
I should've dressed up more.

46:33.079 --> 46:35.893
You're looking beautiful,
same as every other day.

46:35.893 --> 46:38.339
Same as every day?

46:40.417 --> 46:41.713
Ready to grab some food?

46:41.713 --> 46:44.074
There's a place I found
that's just around the corner.

46:44.074 --> 46:46.840
A Michelin one-star chef just launched it.

46:46.840 --> 46:47.674
[Shut for the day, apologies for any trouble]

46:47.674 --> 46:49.726
It's closed?

46:52.179 --> 46:53.453
[This is Firenze. We sincerely apologize
to all our scheduled guests]

46:53.453 --> 46:56.190
Oh, it's closed...

47:00.291 --> 47:03.273
I actually have a backup plan, just in case.

47:03.273 --> 47:04.900
It's a five-minute walk from here.

47:04.900 --> 47:07.444
No reservation, but we're early enough that

47:07.444 --> 47:09.620
there probably won't be a wait.

47:11.034 --> 47:12.909
Lee Hui Jin.

47:12.909 --> 47:14.412
Is Lee Hui Jin here?

47:14.412 --> 47:16.544
Please come in.

47:23.778 --> 47:26.546
Standing through this entire line might mean

47:26.546 --> 47:28.738
we end up late for the film.

47:28.738 --> 47:31.184
Well, in that case...

47:33.499 --> 47:35.333
Tae Seop.

47:35.333 --> 47:37.349
The vibe isn't anything special,

47:37.349 --> 47:40.271
but I know a spot near here with amazing food.

47:40.271 --> 47:42.198
Should we head there instead?

47:42.198 --> 47:45.196
- Yeah, sounds good.
- Okay.

47:50.916 --> 47:52.580
Right.

47:58.999 --> 48:00.546
What?

48:05.509 --> 48:09.297
- Does this rock back and forth a bit?
- A little.

48:09.297 --> 48:11.529
- It's hot.
- Thank you.

48:11.529 --> 48:12.869
- Be careful.
- Thanks.

48:12.869 --> 48:15.208
Move to that side if it bothers you.

48:15.208 --> 48:17.438
I'm good right here.

48:20.542 --> 48:23.022
Being here with you is so strange.

48:23.022 --> 48:24.500
Since our vendors are in the area,

48:24.500 --> 48:26.875
this place has always been
a work lunch spot for me.

48:26.875 --> 48:28.658
I see.

48:29.359 --> 48:31.160
It looks delicious.

48:35.091 --> 48:37.589
If you do it like this,
you save the roof of your mouth

48:37.589 --> 48:38.958
and you can eat faster too.

48:38.958 --> 48:40.670
Got it.

48:47.291 --> 48:49.011
Thanks.

48:49.011 --> 48:50.972
Go ahead, dig in.

48:58.004 --> 48:59.612
- Seriously, this is incredible.
- Right?

48:59.612 --> 49:01.566
What a relief.

49:04.583 --> 49:06.737
It's good.

49:08.416 --> 49:10.792
That was a great meal.

49:10.792 --> 49:12.910
Stay seated for a second.

49:49.958 --> 49:52.074
- All done.
- All done.

49:55.366 --> 49:56.905
Those are some serious skills.

49:56.905 --> 49:58.407
Just a quick fix.

49:58.407 --> 50:01.159
That was totally something.

50:01.159 --> 50:04.962
What got you into building furniture?

50:06.080 --> 50:08.527
We went through a period
where our house had no kitchen table.

50:08.527 --> 50:10.846
Our family hit hard times out of nowhere.

50:10.846 --> 50:14.386
After that, so much just slowly faded away.

50:14.386 --> 50:16.916
Sitting down for dinner stopped happening,

50:16.916 --> 50:18.468
nobody talked anymore,

50:18.468 --> 50:20.639
and being around each other
became uncomfortable.

50:20.639 --> 50:23.735
That's when it hit me
that furniture is more than just objects.

50:23.735 --> 50:27.394
Seeing it through that lens
made it matter so much more.

50:27.394 --> 50:28.850
Making a real difference
felt like the right path.

50:28.850 --> 50:30.942
That whole twenties idealism, you know?

50:30.942 --> 50:32.609
I see.

50:32.609 --> 50:36.361
After I started the company,
all I did was work myself to the bone.

50:36.361 --> 50:38.469
What were your twenties like?

50:38.469 --> 50:40.529
With a personality like yours,
you probably had tons of friends.

50:40.529 --> 50:42.829
Not really, actually.

50:42.829 --> 50:45.203
Growing up without much to spare meant

50:45.203 --> 50:47.189
all I could focus on was my own survival.

50:47.189 --> 50:48.999
Hiding behind my own hardships,

50:48.999 --> 50:51.229
I just assumed
everyone else could tough it out too.

50:51.229 --> 50:54.088
So you had those days as well.

50:54.088 --> 50:56.125
There aren't a lot of good memories
from back then.

50:56.125 --> 50:58.083
Not a single vacation, ever.

50:58.083 --> 51:01.750
And as for romance, I kept my guard up,
telling myself the timing was wrong.

51:01.750 --> 51:02.823
That's alright.

51:02.823 --> 51:06.107
You can do
all the things you missed out on now.

51:08.041 --> 51:09.583
Exactly.

51:09.583 --> 51:13.203
Which is why I'm really happy
with how things are these days.

51:13.203 --> 51:16.492
I'm glad I met you now.

51:45.792 --> 51:47.583
The whole idea of love...

51:47.583 --> 51:49.734
it's so unpredictable.

51:51.583 --> 51:53.083
Even so,

51:53.083 --> 51:56.866
I'm ready to take that leap of faith again.

51:59.625 --> 52:01.658
Why are you crying?

52:01.658 --> 52:02.822
Are you sad?

52:02.822 --> 52:05.083
It's not that, I just...

52:05.083 --> 52:08.127
- My eyes...
- Do your eyes hurt?

52:08.875 --> 52:10.921
Come on, let's step out for now.

52:23.542 --> 52:25.792
Are you okay?

52:25.792 --> 52:27.958
Since I barely ever put contacts in,

52:27.958 --> 52:30.445
I think something got stuck. Kind of burns.

52:30.445 --> 52:33.052
That doesn't seem minor at all.
They're super bloodshot.

52:33.052 --> 52:34.333
Turn this way.

52:34.333 --> 52:36.197
What?

52:37.291 --> 52:39.116
Face me.

52:44.740 --> 52:46.208
Leaving the lenses in is a bad idea.

52:46.208 --> 52:48.793
Get them out as fast as you can.

52:58.291 --> 52:59.302
Feeling any better?

52:59.302 --> 53:00.722
Are they out? How's it now?

53:00.722 --> 53:02.583
- Way better already.
- Yeah.

53:02.583 --> 53:04.261
Want to head back inside?

53:04.261 --> 53:05.981
Back in there?

53:05.981 --> 53:08.121
Your vision's basically gone at this point.

53:08.121 --> 53:10.802
We can catch the film later.
Right now, let's just get you home.

53:10.802 --> 53:11.881
No.

53:11.881 --> 53:14.230
I can't do that.
We have to watch a movie this time.

53:14.230 --> 53:17.321
With your eyes in that condition, though...

53:17.958 --> 53:20.150
Then...

53:20.150 --> 53:23.028
How about we watch something at my apartment?

53:23.028 --> 53:24.667
Your apartment?

53:24.667 --> 53:26.125
Oh, I mean,

53:26.125 --> 53:27.984
I'm not suggesting anything weird.

53:27.984 --> 53:30.918
Putting things off again
just isn't something I want to do.

53:33.708 --> 53:36.340
Then should we grab some popcorn too?

53:36.958 --> 53:39.005
Sure.

53:39.005 --> 53:41.132
Right.

53:41.132 --> 53:44.181
Grab my arm and stay right behind me.

53:56.020 --> 53:57.400
Got it.

53:57.400 --> 53:58.897
Yeah.

53:58.897 --> 54:01.110
The designated driver will be here soon.

54:01.110 --> 54:02.141
I'm sorry.

54:02.141 --> 54:05.780
Got my license and everything,
just never been behind the wheel.

54:05.780 --> 54:07.705
No worries.

54:10.033 --> 54:12.585
I love this song.

54:13.260 --> 54:14.360
Same here.

54:14.360 --> 54:15.921
Really?

55:11.970 --> 55:13.125
Bravo!

55:13.125 --> 55:15.522
You were amazing!

55:17.416 --> 55:18.935
- Nice work tonight.
- You too.

55:18.935 --> 55:20.750
- Stop standing around and get out here.
- Good work.

55:20.750 --> 55:22.108
- Good job.
- Good job.

55:22.108 --> 55:24.333
- Nice work.
- Nice work.

55:24.333 --> 55:25.416
Ji Su.

55:25.416 --> 55:28.462
Someone sent you flowers.
Make sure you grab them.

55:28.462 --> 55:30.120
Thanks.

55:38.037 --> 55:39.263
Congrats on the show.

55:39.263 --> 55:41.002
I have something important to tell you.

55:41.002 --> 55:43.551
I'm at The Hills Seoul, so come see me.

55:47.463 --> 55:49.208
Excuse me, Shin Ji Su.

55:49.208 --> 55:51.024
I'm reporter Kim Ji Young from Dailing.

55:51.024 --> 55:54.723
You're the model C
from the Son Jeong A rumors, correct?

55:54.723 --> 55:57.003
How exactly do you know Son Jeong A?

55:57.003 --> 55:58.903
There's no relationship.

55:58.903 --> 56:01.101
Stay away from me from now on.

56:01.101 --> 56:02.562
Our sources say
the largest backer of the theater company

56:02.562 --> 56:04.464
turns out to be the Seungbo Group.

56:04.464 --> 56:08.193
Apparently Son Jeong A and the chairman's wife
are very close.

56:08.193 --> 56:09.324
Did you know about that?

56:09.324 --> 56:11.404
Particularly in arts and culture,

56:11.404 --> 56:14.543
her involvement reportedly
goes well beyond just advice.

56:14.543 --> 56:16.660
What?

56:16.660 --> 56:18.203
Did the two of you

56:18.203 --> 56:20.958
have some sort of deal

56:20.958 --> 56:24.675
tied to the theater's sponsorship money?

56:27.099 --> 56:28.633
Give me two months and it's finished.

56:28.633 --> 56:30.375
Hey!

56:30.375 --> 56:32.011
Ji Su, what's wrong?

56:32.011 --> 56:34.094
Are you out of your mind?

56:34.094 --> 56:35.883
That whole thing today was planned
to get me onstage, wasn't it?

56:35.883 --> 56:37.823
Yeah, that's called deliberate.
Nobody buys it as luck.

56:37.823 --> 56:39.362
You're twisting my words.

56:39.362 --> 56:43.812
My paychecks, my meals, all of it
came from Son Jeong A's pocket!

56:43.812 --> 56:45.125
Is this really how you treat me?

56:45.125 --> 56:47.810
The chairman's wife at Seungbo Group
backs us because she believes in what we do.

56:47.810 --> 56:48.629
Believes in us?

56:48.629 --> 56:52.403
Who throws money at a theater company
that doesn't turn a profit

56:52.403 --> 56:55.615
and can't be bothered to show up
for one performance?

56:55.615 --> 56:58.913
Cut the crap with your oversized ego already.

56:58.913 --> 57:00.286
It's not about your paycheck.

57:00.286 --> 57:02.580
It's our theater rent, the crew's wages,

57:02.580 --> 57:04.729
food, costumes, props.

57:04.729 --> 57:06.041
Every last one of us
has staked our lives on this,

57:06.041 --> 57:07.870
so if there's a chance to move up, we take it.

57:07.870 --> 57:09.590
The place you treat like some bunker to hide in

57:09.590 --> 57:12.006
is the stage we've been dying to stand on.

57:12.006 --> 57:14.050
Keep straddling the fence like that

57:14.050 --> 57:16.268
and you might as well walk away for good.

57:34.904 --> 57:36.106
Fine. I'm out.

57:36.106 --> 57:38.374
Hey, what are you doing?

57:40.914 --> 57:42.878
I said I'm done.

57:44.626 --> 57:47.216
You can't just say you're quitting.

58:05.188 --> 58:07.361
I'm going to the hotel now.

58:15.423 --> 58:17.867
Give me a sec, I need to grab my glasses.

58:17.867 --> 58:20.103
Just relax on the sofa.

58:20.103 --> 58:21.667
Sure.

58:36.261 --> 58:38.934
This place is spotless.

59:01.783 --> 59:07.254
[Dinner, Coffee Time, Movie, Drive Home]

59:13.416 --> 59:17.181
So every single detail was mapped in advance?

59:17.840 --> 59:19.596
Thing is,

59:19.596 --> 59:22.015
not a single thing followed the script...

59:22.015 --> 59:24.021
Yeah, not a single thing.

59:27.542 --> 59:29.291
Even so,

59:29.291 --> 59:31.153
I had an amazing time.

59:42.166 --> 59:44.041
Feel free to look around if you're bored.

59:44.041 --> 59:46.536
Oh, sure.

01:00:16.444 --> 01:00:18.534
Oh, wait.

01:00:21.291 --> 01:00:23.352
For drinks,

01:00:23.352 --> 01:00:26.732
what would you like?
Water, sparkling water, soda, or green tea?

01:00:26.732 --> 01:00:28.958
Actually... Just water!

01:00:28.958 --> 01:00:30.754
Ice cold!

01:00:31.542 --> 01:00:33.632
Need to snap out of it...

01:00:53.423 --> 01:00:56.583
What kind of movies do you like?

01:00:56.583 --> 01:00:57.999
Honestly, I'll watch

01:00:57.999 --> 01:01:01.003
just about anything as long as it's not scary.

01:01:01.003 --> 01:01:03.351
Horror's off the table for you?

01:01:04.333 --> 01:01:06.291
My heart literally

01:01:06.291 --> 01:01:08.983
can't take that kind of stress.

01:01:08.983 --> 01:01:11.863
Are you into horror films?

01:01:11.863 --> 01:01:13.084
I just watch them.

01:01:13.084 --> 01:01:16.459
Growing up, my father always said
ghosts aren't the ones to worry about.

01:01:16.459 --> 01:01:19.792
Once he told me humans are the real threat,

01:01:19.792 --> 01:01:21.972
nothing on screen could rattle me.

01:01:23.333 --> 01:01:25.767
Those are words to live by.

01:01:29.750 --> 01:01:33.233
People say this one's great.

01:01:35.145 --> 01:01:36.243
[Single in Seoul]
This one?

01:01:36.243 --> 01:01:37.863
Yeah.

01:01:39.125 --> 01:01:40.875
Then,

01:01:40.875 --> 01:01:43.201
should I turn off the lights?

01:01:46.242 --> 01:01:48.168
Sure.

01:01:53.041 --> 01:01:55.094
Hotel work really takes a toll on your hands.

01:01:55.094 --> 01:01:57.049
Make sure you keep them moisturized.

01:01:59.047 --> 01:02:01.803
If there's one thing a hotel never runs out of,
it's lotion.

01:02:06.583 --> 01:02:08.416
What a hidden gem

01:02:08.416 --> 01:02:10.270
of a name.

01:02:57.542 --> 01:02:59.750
Well...

01:02:59.750 --> 01:03:01.697
Ui Yeong...

01:03:02.458 --> 01:03:03.778
Yes?

01:03:03.778 --> 01:03:06.604
There's something I want to say.

01:03:38.291 --> 01:03:40.569
- Oh, son.
- Mother.

01:03:44.451 --> 01:03:46.708
Oh my goodness.

01:03:46.708 --> 01:03:47.902
Are you okay?

01:03:47.902 --> 01:03:49.212
You're not hurt, are you?

01:03:49.212 --> 01:03:51.708
Oh my. Goodness.

01:03:51.708 --> 01:03:53.511
I'm sorry.

01:03:53.511 --> 01:03:54.712
No, it's okay.

01:03:54.712 --> 01:03:58.670
Nice to meet you. Hello.

01:04:00.750 --> 01:04:02.792
What?

01:04:02.792 --> 01:04:04.631
My regular girl?

01:04:04.631 --> 01:04:06.473
Oh, it's you.

01:04:10.958 --> 01:04:12.511
He was right.

01:04:12.511 --> 01:04:15.270
Humans really are the scariest of all.

01:04:31.112 --> 01:04:34.699
[What's done is done, spilled and all]

01:04:34.699 --> 01:04:38.452
[A once-in-a-lifetime mission!]

01:04:38.452 --> 01:04:42.130
[I keep stepping in]

01:04:45.710 --> 01:04:49.380
[Glad we met now]

01:04:49.380 --> 01:04:53.551
[What you mean to me]

01:04:53.551 --> 01:04:56.645
[Shall I turn off the lights?]

01:04:57.934 --> 01:05:00.084
Dating isn't what it used to be.

01:05:00.084 --> 01:05:03.440
In your twenties, all you needed
was the two of you being adorable...

01:05:03.440 --> 01:05:04.941
Unbelievable.

01:05:04.941 --> 01:05:06.786
It's bugging me.

01:05:06.786 --> 01:05:08.611
Unless you're faking your reading
just to steal glances at me,

01:05:08.611 --> 01:05:09.981
how come you haven't gotten past
the first page?

01:05:09.981 --> 01:05:13.328
Your mother wants to know
if you and Ui Yeong are working out.

01:05:14.488 --> 01:05:17.101
When that story runs,
everyone's going to start asking about you.

01:05:17.101 --> 01:05:19.289
Reporters will come looking for you everywhere.

01:05:19.289 --> 01:05:20.401
Go study abroad.

01:05:20.401 --> 01:05:22.079
I don't know much,

01:05:22.079 --> 01:05:25.121
but I hope you hold on to what you love.

01:05:25.121 --> 01:05:27.130
I want to try

01:05:27.130 --> 01:05:29.344
being in love with you.
